{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773170/extras/a01b616be27cc315f256ffc688a58114.avif?t=1757766798\" width=600 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poppet Quest is an exploration based 3D Metroidvania. You play as Poppet, a murdered woman returned to life as a doll. Trapped in a toy store called \u201cWhimsy Wonders\u201d where a curse brings the toys to life at night, while driving them slowly insane. You must battle through legions of toys driven mad.\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773170/extras/a228f1577b56e8970a5b7d2e1c2539ad.avif?t=1757766798\" width=600 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, crawl, climb and sneak through a Steampunk world designed for humans but as a tiny doll. See a world where chairs are now practically buildings, shelves are basically cliffs, and bookcases might as well be mountains. Explore this wondrous and strange place of massive things as you wander through a seven story tall toy store full of all manner of biomes such as a pirate graveyard, secret garden and even a toy city!\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773170/extras/9c08eb2c01288905877513e7e2b28996.avif?t=1757766798\" width=600 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face down all manner of toys, contraptions, and even ghosts as you wield the power of the Tarot against them! Utilize 50+ abilities based on the Major Arcana of the Tarot, such as a giant mallet, powerful dice, exploding mushrooms, and even the ability to hang yourself at range! (Don\u2019t worry you\u2019re a doll you won\u2019t suffocate.)\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773170/extras/2b717e0b1dd3d19272607b2f1684e9ff.avif?t=1757766798\" width=600 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet all manner of bizarre, strange and unusual characters as you uncover the mysteries of the toymaker, the origins of Whimsy Wonders, and what happened to the other victims as you seek out a way to break the curse and free yourself. Your Poppet Quest begins now! Time is wasting, and by morning it will be too late. Can you break the curse? Can you save yourself? Or will you be lost forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773170/extras/85088b0719502e212f1157bd734388e9.avif?t=1757766798\" width=600 height=240 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3773170?t=1757766798","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773170/8e1af545269f08efbc9eeb4ffafc3988d9db2cee/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757766798","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773170/65442d00cc4749a573de4e6b005dc5d69e8f1b09/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757766798","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773170/65442d00cc4749a573de4e6b005dc5d69e8f1b09/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757766798","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence, General Mature Content"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773170/extras/a01b616be27cc315f256ffc688a58114.avif